Subject: [PATCH 6/7] multi-resource: by-resource planning grid and resource
 filters

- planning.php: planningLignesRessource() helper; the by-resource bucket
  assignments iterate a task's full resource set so it shows on every one of
  its resource rows; masquerLigneVide builds all resource rows when the option
  is on; resource filter is junction-aware
- taches.php: task-list resource filter junction-aware
